      "source": "sections/sec-026-222-about-the-data.md",
      "source_hash": "24ff76eba777f734efbc14cd9204abe6150946f151c425685bdf85870c8e703a",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Explains that facility morbidity data do not capture the full disease burden but can show patterns, and describes how diagnoses are coded and collected for outpatient and inpatient care.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
