        {
          "text": "Annex 10 gives model answers to the exercise questions throughout the routine health facility data guidance, based on the Lupara district dashboards. Early answers interpret patterns such as a December spike in institutional mortality and the age and sex distribution of outpatient visits. Later answers address coverage, quality and resource indicators, including data quality concerns. The last answer advises limiting fourth-quarter spending to essential activities given budget execution.",
